      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "CURIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "With this new Shade you can now enter \\c[3]Gaia's Garden\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Dass wir mit dieser neuen Form nach \\c[3]Gaias Garten\\c[0] können."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "UP"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "And well... that area is supposed to be a \\c[3]jungle\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Und...\\. na ja...\\. Gaias Garten ist eigentlich ein \\c[3]Dschungel\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "AWAY"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...!",
       "transl": "...!"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "ASTONISHED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "You know what you usually find in jungles?",
       "transl": "Du weißt, auf was man so im Dschungel trifft, oder?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SWEATY_SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...?",
       "transl": "...?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "NERVOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "Insects...\\. like \\c[3]bugs\\c[0].",
       "transl": "Insekten...\\. wie zum Beispiel \\c[3]Käfer\\c[0]."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "EXHAUSTED"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "...",
       "transl": "..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.lea",
       "expression": "SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "I really don't want to go there by myself.\\. So uhm...",
       "transl": "Ich will da wirklich nicht alleine reingehen.\\. Also, öhm..."
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SUSPICIOUS"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "It would be great if you could wait for me so we can enter the Jungle together, d'accord?",
       "transl": "... wär's echt toll, wenn du auf mich warten könntest, damit wir den Dschungel gemeinsam betreten können, d'accord?"
      },
      "person": {
       "person": "main.emilie",
       "expression": "SWEATY_SMILE"
      }
     },
     {
      "message": {
       "orig": "[nods]",
